Attempts exhausted (last, it leaves the cluster on node 3 closed): node 3 misses ALTER CLUSTER ADD t2 and a regular file where it would create the t2 directory makes every SST of t2 to node 3 fail; both rejoin attempts fail, the cluster stays closed with the reason in last_error, the daemon keeps running
––– block: ../base/replication/rejoin-pause-node3 –––
